    "created_at": "2021-01-27T09:47:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-27T09:47:07Z",
    "body": "Yeah, if the top-level environment is a secure context, nested ones will be too.\r\n\r\nI think we could make environment a new argument to \"obtain an embedder policy\", but perhaps this is not great for \"check a navigation response's adherence to its embedder policy\"? Though in that case it only matters if the parent is a secure context. Perhaps some slight restructuring is in order.",
